    "database": {
        "engine": "sqlite",
        "mongodbUri": "",
        "_notes": "engine: 'sqlite' (default, no setup needed) or 'mongodb'. If 'mongodb', set mongodbUri and GoatBot-format commands' usersData/threadsData/globalData will use MongoDB (migrated from Xrahat-BoT) instead of the SQLite tables. SQLite itself is never disabled - this only affects that one shim."
